x","content":"Run `exakit start`"},"1673":{"id":"/kit/data/run-sql-14","page_id":"/kit/data/run-sql","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/kit/data/run-sql#errors-come-with-their-fix","content":"`FETCH FIRST` or `TOP`"},"1674":{"id":"/kit/data/run-sql-15","page_id":"/kit/data/run-sql","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/kit/data/run-sql#errors-come-with-their-fix","content":"Use `LIMIT`"},"1675":{"id":"/kit/data/run-sql-16","page_id":"/kit/data/run-sql","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/kit/data/run-sql#errors-come-with-their-fix","content":"Object not found"},"1676":{"id":"/kit/data/run-sql-17","page_id":"/kit/data/run-sql","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/kit/data/run-sql#errors-come-with-their-fix","content":"Describe it first"},"1677":{"id":"/kit/data/run-sql-18","page_id":"/kit/data/run-sql","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/kit/data/run-sql#errors-come-with-their-fix","content":"The fix is printed first, with the error."},"1678":{"id":"/kit/data/run-sql-19","page_id":"/kit/data/run-sql","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/kit/data/run-sql#for-a-script","content":"One JSON object comes back and nothing else: the rows and their count on success, or the error with a command to run, when there is one."},"1679":{"id":"/kit/data/run-sql-20","page_id":"/kit/data/run-sql","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/kit/data/run-sql#for-a-script","content":"On Windows PowerShell 5.1, a double quote inside an argument is dropped before `exakit` runs. Pass a statement with quoted names through `--file`."},"1680":{"id":"/kit/tools/add-ons","page_id":"/kit/tools/add-ons","type":"page","content":"Add-ons","breadcrumbs":["Documentation","All personas","Tools"],"tags":[],"url":"/kit/tools/add-ons"},"1681":{"id":"/kit/tools/add-ons-0","page_id":"/kit/tools/add-ons","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/kit/tools/add-ons","content":"Optional tools the kit can install, start, update and remove - the marketplace."},"1682":{"id":"/kit/tools/add-ons-1","page_id":"/kit/tools/add-ons","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/